config BR2_PACKAGE_MSM8974_DIAG
	bool "msm8974-diag"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3
	help
	  Diagnostics for the MSM8974 CPU power and clock path.

	  Read-only register probes (PMIC power-on/power-off reason,
	  HFPLL rates and lock state, SAW gang-rail voltage, per-core
	  LDO/BHS state, APC SMPS setpoints), DVFS stressors, and
	  resumable soak harnesses that keep fsync'd logs so a silent
	  reset still leaves evidence.

	  Written while investigating resets that produce no kernel
	  output at all on the 6.18 fork. See the package README for the
	  measurements, the safety rules (never offline a CPU, never
	  leave scaling_min_freq pinned high) and how to deploy onto a
	  freshly flashed device.
